        <!-- Q1 -->
        <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200">
          <input type="radio" name="faq-accordion" checked="checked" /> 
          <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium font-jakarta">
            Is this just another AI wrapper?
          </div>
          <div class="collapse-content font-jakarta"> 
            <p>Not at all. While we use powerful LLMs, Stencil-AI is a true workflow tool. Our key innovation is the 'one-to-many' concurrent generation using reusable 'Stencils'. It's about structured, repeatable, multi-faceted output, not just conversation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q2 -->
        <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200">
          <input type="radio" name="faq-accordion" /> 
          <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium font-jakarta">
            Who is the ideal user for Stencil-AI?
          </div>
          <div class="collapse-content font-jakarta"> 
            <p>Stencil-AI is built for technical professionals who deal with a high degree of context-switching—developers, indie hackers, founders, and product managers. If you find yourself constantly documenting code, creating diagrams, and writing summaries, Stencil-AI is designed to streamline that entire process.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q3 -->
        <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200">
          <input type="radio" name="faq-accordion" /> 
          <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium font-jakarta">
            What exactly are 'Stencils' and can I make my own?
          </div>
          <div class="collapse-content font-jakarta"> 
            <p>A Stencil is a reusable, super-powered prompt you can design once and run forever. You have full control to create your own private Stencils, and eventually, you'll be able to subscribe to a marketplace of Stencils created by other experts.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q4 -->
        <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200">
          <input type="radio" name="faq-accordion" /> 
          <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium font-jakarta">
            How is my data handled? Is it used for training?
          </div>
          <div class="collapse-content font-jakarta"> 
            <p>We take your privacy seriously. To generate responses, your conversation data is sent to third-party AI model providers. While we do not use your data to train our own models, the use of this service is subject to our Terms of Service. We advise against submitting any sensitive personal, financial, or proprietary information, and we are not liable for the security of data transmitted to third-party services.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q5 -->
        <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200">
          <input type="radio" name="faq-accordion" /> 
          <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium font-jakarta">
