          </div>
          <div class="collapse-content font-jakarta"> 
            <p>Stencil-AI is free to try during our beta period, which includes a limited number of credits so you can fully test the product's capabilities. After the beta, we will introduce paid plans based on usage and access to advanced features and models.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q6 -->
        <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200">
          <input type="radio" name="faq-accordion" /> 
