          </div>
          <div class="collapse-content font-jakarta"> 
            <p>Currently, all inputs are treated as text. However, the system is designed to handle a wide variety of text-based content, including snippets of code, business plans, and technical documentation. We are actively working on expanding our input capabilities.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Q7 -->
        <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200">
          <input type="radio" name="faq-accordion" /> 
          <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium font-jakarta">
            How does sharing Stencils work?
          </div>
          <div class="collapse-content font-jakarta"> 
